		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ジョディ『……Say, Bob
do I smell like garlic?▼
I had this really
good steak yesterday,▼
but the garlic was
awfully strong!▼
I'm not making you
hold your breath, am I?▼
……Bob? What makes you
so quiet today?▼
Do I smell THAT bad?
Oh my …… huh? What?▼
えっ　ウソッ　もう
はじまってるの！？▼
ハッ……　ハーイ　みんな！
ま……また『TRADE'N TALK』みてね！▽
グッバーイ！▼
……　……　……
……　……　……</Text>
