			<Comment>■バラエティ
・担当：派遣（松宮）</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T07:30:13" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
